<title>UK: KfW unit sets 100 million Swiss franc step-up bond.</title>
<headline>KfW unit sets 100 million Swiss franc step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE INC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     *3.0	MATURITY  **26.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102.50    PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STANDARD  LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   07.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10+100    SALE LIMITS US/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST THREE YEARS THEN STEPS UP TO 4.25 PCT TO</p>
<p>		 MATURITY</p>
<p>	     **CALL AFTER YEAR FOUR AT PAR</p>
<p>		 REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
